---
const skills = [
  { label: 'frontend', value: 92, color: 'cyan' },
  { label: 'design', value: 78, color: 'magenta' },
  { label: 'pixel-art', value: 65, color: 'yellow' },
];
---

<section class="py-8 md:py-12">
  <div class="reveal reveal-1 section-index mb-6">
    <span>003</span>
    <span class="text-neon-cyan">·</span>
    <span>SYSTEM</span>
  </div>

  <div class="grid gap-10 md:grid-cols-[1.3fr_1fr] md:items-start lg:gap-14">
    <div class="reveal reveal-2">
      <h1 class="font-pixel text-[1.2rem] text-neon-yellow md:text-[1.5rem]">
        &gt; whoami
      </h1>

      <p class="mt-5 font-terminal text-xl text-type-base">
        我在 <span class="text-neon-cyan">代码</span>、
        <span class="text-neon-magenta">视觉</span>、
        <span class="text-neon-yellow">怀旧</span>
        三角带里反复横跳。白天写东西，晚上拆东西，凌晨大概在看 90~00 年代的科幻动画。
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4 max-w-lg font-terminal text-lg text-type-dim">
        TRANICI 是我的个人终端，也是一次把 Wanderful 式 cinematic hero 和像素终端风格融合起来的实验。
      </p>

      <div class="mt-7 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3">
        <a href="mailto:hi@tranici.dev" class="pixel-btn">
          ✉ hi@tranici.dev
        </a>
        <a
          href="#"
          class="font-pixel text-[0.7rem] uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-type-dim hover:text-neon-magenta"
        >
          &gt; download.cv
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="reveal reveal-3 pixel-border-cyan bg-ink-deep/90">
      <div class="win-chrome">
        <span class="win-chrome__dots">
          <span></span><span></span><span></span>
        </span>
        <span>tranici@terminal:~$ neofetch</span>
      </div>
      <div class="px-5 py-4 font-terminal text-base text-type-dim">
        <dl class="space-y-1.5 leading-relaxed">
          <div class="flex justify-between gap-4">
            <dt>host</dt><dd class="text-type-base">tranici-terminal</dd>
          </div>
          <div class="flex justify-between gap-4">
            <dt>os</dt><dd class="text-type-base">y2k.os 2.0</dd>
          </div>
          <div class="flex justify-between gap-4">
            <dt>uptime</dt><dd class="text-type-base">since 2026</dd>
          </div>
          <div class="flex justify-between gap-4">
            <dt>shell</dt><dd class="text-type-base">/bin/curiosity</dd>
          </div>
          <div class="flex justify-between gap-4">
            <dt>stack</dt><dd class="text-type-base">astro · react · canvas</dd>
          </div>
          <div class="flex justify-between gap-4">
            <dt>mood</dt><dd class="text-neon-yellow">CONNECTED ▒▒▒</dd>
          </div>
        </dl>

        <div class="mt-5 space-y-2 border-t border-type-dim/20 pt-4">
          {
            skills.map((row) => (
              <div>
                <div class="flex justify-between font-accent text-[0.55rem] uppercase tracking-widest">
                  <span>/{row.label}</span>
                  <span class="tabular-nums text-type-dim">{row.value}%</span>
                </div>
                <div class="mt-1 h-1.5 w-full bg-ink-base">
                  <div
                    class={`h-full ${row.color === 'cyan' ? 'bg-neon-cyan' : row.color === 'magenta' ? 'bg-neon-magenta' : 'bg-neon-yellow'}`}
                    style={`width: ${row.value}%`}
                  ></div>
                </div>
              </div>
            ))
          }
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
